==Description==
The '''Snow Day Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained at Level 14 of the regular [[The Final Act Event#The Final Act Battle Pass|The Final Act Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{PlushieSnowman|390}} or {{Robux|58}} ({{Robux|46}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{PlushieSnowman|2,605}} or {{Robux|960}} ({{Robux|762}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale).

It has light blue text surrounded by a translucent dark blue outline. The text is covered in snow, which is melting. There are icicles on the bottom of the nametag. On that snow there is a giant snowman with two stone eyes, a carrot for a nose, black top hat and a red scarf. Snowflakes and strong winds also appear around the nametag.

